        "subject": "Alligator Attack Claims Life of 71-Year-Old Fisherman in Florida",
        "summary": "This event concerns the fatal alligator attack on Steven Hamilton, a 71-year-old Winter Garden resident, while he was fishing at Dr. Bradford Memorial Park in central Florida. Authorities said the incident occurred on October 16, 2026, and involved a nearly 12-foot alligator that was subsequently removed by a contracted trapper as investigators examined the death.",
