          },
          {
            "label": "Victim and official response",
            "value": "Officials identified the victim as Steven Hamilton, 71. Winter Garden police and the Florida Fish and Wildlife Conservation Commission investigated, and an FWC-contracted nuisance-alligator trapper removed the animal, reported as 11 feet 8 inches long by FWC.",
